            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "Some metadata and open answers were dropped from the raw data before uploading. The ResponseID variable was alterad from the original. These changes were made for data protection reasons. They do not affect the replicability of the analyses for the paper \"Diverging Ethnic Hierarchies? Cultural Distance, Right-Wing Authoritarianism, and Social Distance Perceptions in the Netherlands\"."
